# Shared visual vocabulary for the D2 architecture maps.
#
# Keep canonical diagram colors boring and semantic:
# - blue: UI / trigger edge
# - amber: main-only/session/structural edit
# - green: compiled snapshot/cache data
# - purple: audio graph
# - gray: runtime/diagnostics
# - red dashed edge: forbidden realtime dependency
#
# This file is documentation for authors. Current diagrams duplicate style
# declarations directly so each D2 source can render standalone.
